├── [ApiGateway]   POST /api/v1/orders                     |================= 118 ms =================|
    └── [Ordering.API] OrdersController.PlaceOrder          |============== 106 ms ==============|
        ├── [PostgreSQL] INSERT INTO ordering.orders          |== 14 ms ==|
        ├── [Catalog.API] POST /api/v1/catalog/items/3/reserve            |====== 62 ms ======|
